-                    cv->wait(lock, [this, fence] {
+                    // Velox: the predicate used to take mMutex while holding the fence mutex,
+                    // the reverse of the order in on_vkQueueSubmit (mMutex, then the fence
+                    // mutex), which deadlocks when a sync wait races with a submission. The
+                    // state is only written with the fence mutex held, so read it under that
